  "system": {
    "slug": "mystaria-stage-2",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 5
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>At Stage II, Mystaria has undergone significant cybernetic enhancement. Her M-13 Raptor sniper rifle interfaces with her neural targeting system for long-range precision, her second-generation phase cloak recharges between uses rather than requiring full rest, and a kinetic barrier has been integrated into her suit. She is faster and more dangerous than before, and shows the first signs of the cold precision that defines full Phantoms — though she retains her cunning and adaptability.</p><p><strong>Sneak Attack:</strong> Mystaria deals an extra 1d6 precision damage to Off-Guard creatures.</p><p><strong>Phantom Cloak (1 action):</strong> Mystaria becomes Invisible until the end of her next turn or until she makes a Strike. The cloak recharges after 1d4+1 rounds.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 30 Shield HP. Recharges 10 HP per turn.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publication": {
        "title": "Mass Effect Compendium",
        "authors": "nscarpinatodev",
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": true
      },
